{"agent":"buglane2","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The new `_next_token(...)` call carries only `kind`, `phase`, `phase_only`, and `tags`; it does not pass the `wave` filter that the change states it must carry. As written, a run such as `ddflow next --wave 3` cut by `[output].max_rows` produces a next-page footer without `--wave 3`, so the printed cursor is applied to the list without the wave filter, reproducing the dropped-filter bug for wave.","digest":"6746f2f985f9c0da","family":"alibaba","location":"ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py:72","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py:72"},{"chunk":2,"detail":"The stated fix says the non-lane `next` token must carry wave as well as phase/kind/phase_only/tag, but neither the parser nor the token builder has any wave handling: `_next_flags` only recognizes `--kind`, `--phase`, `--phase-only`, and `--tag`, and `next_token` has no `wave` parameter or `--wave` output. Given a wave-narrowed non-lane next command such as `next --wave 1 --phase P`, `_next_flags` ignores `--wave`, `_entry` returns `ddflow next --phase P`, and `_page_calls` prints the page footer as `ddflow next --phase P --cursor 50`. The next page is therefore filtered by phase but not by wave, so it can include tasks from other waves, reproducing the paging-drops-filters bug for wave filters. If `next_token` is intended to carry a separate wave filter, its current signature `(kind, phase, phase_only, tags=())` cannot express it without callers misusing `tags`.","digest":"b5a806c97e3ebd7f","family":"alibaba","location":"ddflow/views/output_caps.py:_next_flags / next_token","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"HIGH","title":"ddflow/views/output_caps.py:_next_flags / next_token"},{"chunk":3,"detail":"The regression test exercises `phase`, `kind`, `tag`, and `phase_only`, but it never exercises `wave`, even though the stated fix carries `wave` in the command token. A regression that drops `--wave` / `wave=` from the next-page token would pass this test. For example, if `_next_flags` emits `--wave 3` today but later changes to omit `wave` unless some other filter is present, the token for `ddflow next --phase P-coordination --wave 3` cut by `max_rows` would page the wrong unfiltered-by-wave list, while this test still passes because no `_nonlane_footer` call supplies `wave` and no assertion checks the wave flag.","digest":"e87cb08ce4b9178a","family":"alibaba","location":"tests/test_output_caps.py:test_next_page_footer_names_the_same_filtered_list","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"LOW","title":"tests/test_output_caps.py:test_next_page_footer_names_the_same_filtered_list"}],"chunks_total":3,"combined_gates":["rubber_duck","critic"],"coverage":"3/3 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":7595,"diff_sha":"492ac55b5dc4b953808c3593f03f54f21cb23f455ac23b7c9668bd79bd82e0e0","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/fix-B-next-paging-drops-filters","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":252.6,"family":"alibaba","findings":3,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"58433131038163a0","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B-next-paging-drops-filters.rubber_duck.[REDACTED:name].20261113T052153Z-545f5617.jsonl","reason":"","review_id":"7e5a5b4cb22d","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3],"reviewed_head":"e22d46b3418669914253b65bfe4689e944456d34","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py":"100644 8f8660b6f87cf0c7b03ccc6e74e77882628d1555","ddflow/views/output_caps.py":"100644 68fde44cf51572caafe5e02bf53203f0d776da45","tests/test_output_caps.py":"100644 d2bece13846fc65b9ad72780980a534c255ba2be"},"reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","reviewer_digest":"3926c0df5644d7de","reviewer_families":["alibaba"],"round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py:72","ddflow/views/output_caps.py:_next_flags / next_token","tests/test_output_caps.py:test_next_page_footer_names_the_same_filtered_list"],"tree_sha":"e22d46b34186+clean","unreviewed":[],"waves":1},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"3 finding(s)"},"id":"e23115ea0f5bfb6da20d496e7","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":190378,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B-next-paging-drops-filters","ts":"2026-11-13T05:26:05.911601Z"}
